<title>SPAIN: Spain's Prosegur 1996 net profit up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Prosegur 1996 net profit up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish security firm Prosegur said on Tuesday its net profit rose seven percent to 3.49 billion pesetas in 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement the company gave the following results (in billion pesetas):</p>
<p>					   1996	1995    pct change</p>
<p>    Turnover			  66.68  vs 55.73    20</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     5.01  vs  4.40    14</p>
<p>    Net profit			 3.49  vs  3.25     7</p>
<p>At around 1200 GMT Prosegur shares were trading 35 pesetas higher to 1,390 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
